      "title": "Apple Mail added four convenient new features in iOS 27",
      "content": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/06/apple-mail-app-icon-ios-27.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">iOS 27 brings new features to <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/06/08/heres-everything-new-for-apple-wallet-in-ios-27/\" type=\"post\" id=\"1055623\">Apple Wallet</a>, <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/06/09/heres-everything-new-for-apple-maps-in-ios-27/\" type=\"post\" id=\"1055791\">Maps</a>, <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/06/10/heres-everything-new-for-apple-notes-in-ios-27/\" type=\"post\" id=\"1056067\">Notes</a>, <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/06/10/heres-everything-new-for-messages-in-ios-27/\" type=\"post\" id=\"1056016\">Messages</a>, and <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/guides/ios-27/\" type=\"ninetofive_guides\" id=\"590185065\">more</a>—and it packs key upgrades for the Mail app too. Here’s everything new for Apple Mail in iOS 27.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"apple-mail,ios-27\" data-layer-viewtype=\"unknown\" data-post-id=\"1059201\" href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/09/heres-everything-new-for-apple-mail-in-ios-27/#more-1059201\" class=\"more-link\">more…</a>",
